{
  "name": "Evaluate workflow comparison",
  "description": "Grade retained comparison outputs with a captured rubric, fresh artifact reviewers or frozen checks, idempotent receipts, and a separate evaluator usage scope. Scripts select and record samples through this Interlock's HTTP API. No model provider or winner selection.",
